{"overview":"مایا مارتن، وکیلی درخشان در لندن، با یک تماس تلفنی در حین دویدن صبحگاهی‌اش، زندگی‌اش از هم می‌پاشد: پسرش ربوده شده است. برای بازگرداندن او، او باید به دویدن ادامه دهد، از هر فرمان بی‌رحمانه‌ای اطاعت کند و به هیچ‌کس اعتماد نکند - هر ثانیه آزمایشی است که نشان می‌دهد یک مادر تا چه حد برای نجات فرزندش پیش خواهد رفت.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Maia Marten, a brilliant London lawyer, has her life shattered by a single call on her morning run: her son has been taken. To get him back, she must keep running, obey every ruthless command, and trust no one-each second a test of how far a mother will go to save her child.","tagline_en":"One hour. One chance to save her son.","runtime":86,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["کوین مک‌دانلد"],"crew_en":["Kevin Macdonald"],"countries":["US","GB"],"cast":[{"name":"گل گدوت","role":"Maia","photo":"/AbXKtWQwuDiwhoQLh34VRglwuBE.jpg","en":"Gal Gadot"},{"name":"دامیان لوئیس","role":"The Caller","photo":"/puOXtVatFnAxoOmsFO8z7KTfyJW.jpg","en":"Damian Lewis"},{"name":"روری ویلموت","role":"Noah","photo":"/qi56VP9tSU0F0VJ59Aq0yU4nIR9.jpg","en":"Rory Wilmot"},{"name":"آلفرد ایناک","role":"Ted","photo":"/eEVvPHmxRBcEGqtoTujncmwNDhR.jpg","en":"Alfred Enoch"},{"name":"Phoenix Di Sebastiani","role":"Tafa","photo":"/mBkkZ5irQZPsxdcCIPLCvNv5iT8.jpg"},{"name":"Nathan Kirby","role":"Wiry Dude","photo":"/5bnrS0ZncCFaL1DCm7n7Z6qHBlL.jpg"},{"name":"Hélder Fernandes","role":"Buddy","photo":"/rt8Cp421KbfANb6b6AmMGlVz8wR.jpg"},{"name":"Will Austin","role":"NCA Officer 1","photo":"/hwlsIMEImnpOc046cROxtVyJ2Ao.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Hampton","role":"NCA Officer 2","photo":"/1QU9wjU4fxzYmJALQREMJYSVzS8.jpg"},{"name":"Stevie Binns","role":"NCA Officer 3","photo":"/8z91lF6y3CFTT55YVC3qcBHLO1L.jpg"},{"name":"John Leader","role":"Forensics Officer","photo":"/861Sr9u3AhZX0UIeOj3UnTm3gcF.jpg"},{"name":"Kenton Lloyd Morgan","role":"Boat Captain","photo":""}],"trailer":"zz4rsZLcauY","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movi